A||N||9||SloPonti||Oil in air intake and filter||||5
Z||000000||SloPonti||09-27-1999||09:53 PM||||i check my air filter on a regular basis and the last few times there has been oil around the air filter and the air filter seems like either wet or like oil has splashed up on it! i only put four quarts of oil in her so i know that it is not to much oil but i don't know why there is oil up there? does anyone know why or has anyone else have this problem also?<BR>thanks||||reg||5
Z||000001||sluppy123||09-27-1999||10:04 PM||||I have had the same problem for about 2 year's and have never figured it out, I know the oil is coming up throught the crankcase breather filter. The PCV valve is working and the engine runs great.<P>We discused this in a eariler thread but we never sorted it out||||reg||1
